OL,3,ACreate more jobs for under-25s by
OL,4,Acutting National Insurance, key report
OL,5,Aurges
OL,6,
OL,7,FNational Insurance (NI) paid by firms
OL,8,Fon under-25s should be gradually
OL,9,Flowered to help create more jobs, a
OL,10,Fmajor report will urge.
OL,12,FThere are nearly one million 16-24
OL,13,Fyear-olds not in employment, education
OL,14,For training (Neets) in the UK, official
OL,15,Ffigures show.
OL,17,FReducing NI costs for firms starting
OL,18,Fwith retail and hospitality firms -
OL,19,Fwhich provide almost 40% of jobs for
OL,20,Fthese people - will help improve their
OL,21,Fopportunities, the report will suggest.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
