OL,3,ACreate more jobs for under-25s by
OL,4,Acutting National Insurance, key report
OL,5,Aurges
OL,6,
OL,7,FCollette Osborne, a hairdresser who
OL,8,Fowns two salons in Nottingham, said she
OL,9,Ffeels "suffocated by employment costs"
OL,10,Fincluding NI and while she used to
OL,11,Femploy eight apprentices a year, now
OL,12,Fshe cannot afford to take on any.
